{"slug":"linear-search","title":"Linear Search","topic":"basics","difficulty":"easy","order":47,"tags":["arrays","search","break"],"timeLimitMs":2000,"concept":{"title":"Searching and stopping early","body":["To find a value in an array, look at the elements one by one from the start. This is **linear search**. In the worst case you look at all `n` elements, so the cost grows with `n`: it is **O(n)**.","Once you have found what you want there is no reason to continue. The `break` statement leaves the loop immediately. Remember the position when you break.",{"code":"answer = -1                 # -1 means \"not found\"\nfor i in range(n):\n    if a[i] == x:\n        answer = i\n        break"},"Because positions start at 0, the first element has index 0, not 1. Use a special value that cannot be a valid index (like -1) for \"not found\"."]},"statement":["You are given `n` integers and a number `x`. Print the position (counting from 0) of the **first** element equal to `x`, or `-1` if `x` does not occur."],"inputFormat":["The first line has `n`. The second line has `n` integers. The third line has `x`."],"outputFormat":["The 0-based index of the first occurrence of `x`, or `-1`."],"constraints":["1 <= n <= 1000","-10^9 <= each number, x <= 10^9"],"examples":[{"input":"5\n4 8 15 8 23\n8\n","output":"1\n","note":"8 first appears at index 1."},{"input":"3\n1 2 3\n9\n","output":"-1\n","note":"9 is not in the array."}],"hints":["Go through the indexes 0, 1, ..., n - 1 and compare `a[i]` with `x`.","Start with the answer `-1`. When you find a match, store `i` and stop the loop with `break`.","If the same number appears twice, the first index is wanted: that is why you stop at the first match."],"starter":{"python":"n = int(input())\na = list(map(int, input().split()))\nx = int(input())\n\n# Your code here\n","cpp":"#include <iostream>\n#include <vector>\n#include <string>\nusing namespace std;\n\nint main() {\n    long long n;\n    cin >> n;\n    vector<long long> a(n);\n    for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) cin >> a[i];\n    long long x;\n    cin >> x;\n\n    // Your code here\n\n    return 0;\n}\n","java":"import java.util.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\n        long n = sc.nextLong();\n        long[] a = new long[(int) n];\n        for (int i = 0; i < a.length; i++) a[i] = sc.nextLong();\n        long x = sc.nextLong();\n\n        // Your code here\n    }\n}\n"},"solution":{"explanation":["The loop checks the elements from the left. At the first match it saves the index and leaves the loop; if there is no match the answer stays -1."],"complexity":"Time O(n), space O(1) besides the input.","code":{"python":"n = int(input())\na = list(map(int, input().split()))\nx = int(input())\n\nanswer = -1\nfor i in range(n):\n    if a[i] == x:\n        answer = i\n        break\nprint(answer)\n","cpp":"#include <iostream>\n#include <vector>\n#include <string>\nusing namespace std;\n\nint main() {\n    long long n;\n    cin >> n;\n    vector<long long> a(n);\n    for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) cin >> a[i];\n    long long x;\n    cin >> x;\n\n    int answer = -1;\n    for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n        if (a[i] == x) {\n            answer = i;\n            break;\n        }\n    }\n    cout << answer << endl;\n\n    return 0;\n}\n","java":"import java.util.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\n        long n = sc.nextLong();\n        long[] a = new long[(int) n];\n        for (int i = 0; i < a.length; i++) a[i] = sc.nextLong();\n        long x = sc.nextLong();\n\n        int answer = -1;\n        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n            if (a[i] == x) {\n                answer = i;\n                break;\n            }\n        }\n        System.out.println(answer);\n    }\n}\n"}},"tests":[{"input":"5\n4 8 15 8 23\n8\n","output":"1\n"},{"input":"3\n1 2 3\n9\n","output":"-1\n"},{"input":"1\n5\n5\n","output":"0\n"},{"input":"1\n5\n6\n","output":"-1\n"},{"input":"3\n7 7 7\n7\n","output":"0\n"},{"input":"4\n1 2 3 4\n4\n","output":"3\n"},{"input":"4\n1 2 3 4\n1\n","output":"0\n"},{"input":"3\n-5 0 5\n-5\n","output":"0\n"},{"input":"26\n-17 -1 2 0 6 7 4 -19 3 -15 -17 -6 -11 2 -1 12 -9 8 6 12 -16 2 15 11 6 8\n-22\n","output":"-1\n"},{"input":"33\n20 -11 -19 -6 -15 -20 -7 4 -12 -7 3 7 1 -16 -10 -12 16 -7 10 -9 -7 15 -19 6 -2 -9 0 16 18 -3 13 -12 -19\n-15\n","output":"4\n"},{"input":"2\n7 3\n-16\n","output":"-1\n"},{"input":"39\n-9 -11 19 -7 8 3 -4 4 -20 3 -7 -8 19 -12 17 -6 -16 -19 19 -18 -5 -1 8 -6 6 16 -15 12 8 11 -20 -14 -17 -2 -13 11 -7 -18 -3\n10\n","output":"-1\n"},{"input":"1000\n-680208576 535071456 -809029047 -544949156 363602760 778292460 -456647421 -898029448 -707274028 -489315482 796025448 452153434 946333067 -666762167 -974683719 662674713 -408431550 424104640 955118301 -545739126 -365386621 -28637978 909855865 -905509123 92176085 -429640847 -573519916 226373545 410451047 -181466849 840286863 -686802406 389417843 -309354359 -323824539 -644823085 960294229 919776046 -72453481 347475333 251967975 -88507532 402020590 676465399 -643103515 85223083 830731376 196804074 346703538 322860068 -689716073 -449075865 14642543 286793890 -630644163 -869111749 -445091615 -368328762 -325782729 248068404 705774694 -653354633 58763943 245316203 -987709580 977356292 925905959 -324957128 -758513895 348733922 278141139 -715085893 620641512 81731628 798996042 923849621 -804305304 -379557393 105821956 241900746 -641219010 813592477 -732459418 -34300205 605124091 227843852 301993342 -119816260 277354465 483344901 575575813 -650924847 -588698795 -954349707 893236889 376909677 631493018 110488211 843281650 -712520308 -290744143 127163371 -828603731 -315497289 -8145476 722677840 -806472593 -850301405 -35388707 -89632456 538070129 -889670368 -542661816 414407999 435614639 280706363 371124204 467337287 -735108332 461985999 -519369634 457114047 -952162465 -682759535 -7333